+/*  « Couleurs globales » (Nuancier du document): the global colors of the
+ *  active image (path/chopgimp-vcolors.h), in a grid or a list:
+ *
+ *    [Liste]
+ *    ◩ ◩ ◩ ◩          (swatch with the white corner triangle « globale »;
+ *                     tooltip: name, #rrggbb, number of objects using it)
+ *    [+] [✎] [Aa] [🗑] [Fond] [Contour] [Délier]
+ *
+ *  - Nouvelle couleur globale: the fill of the selected object, else the
+ *    foreground color (the selected objects are then linked to it);
+ *  - Modifier (or a double-click): the color dialog; every linked object
+ *    follows live, OK is one undo step;
+ *  - Renommer, Supprimer (the objects keep the color);
+ *  - Appliquer au fond / au contour: the selected objects follow it;
+ *  - Délier: their fill and stroke stop following global colors.
+ *
+ *  Under CHOPGIMP_NO_VOBJECTS=1 the panel only says that the objects are
+ *  off (its action is hidden).
+ */
